From 7fbf5d251a119980922bab3e6a5ae9bcf3db97db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robert DeLanghe <1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 13:32:09 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] test(path-cli): hermetic goldens for codex<->claude over real
 fixtures, pin the 09-29 codex->claude type leak

tests/goldens.rs runs derive+project/export with an empty env (temp HOME/XDG/store dirs, cwd /), compares byte-for-byte with a line diff on failure, and with GOLDENS_UPDATE=1 regenerates goldens/ and manifest.json (input/output sha256, command, rev). known-defect/ pins the foreign entry types codex->claude currently emits (toolpath-transform-regression-goal report, 2026-09-29) as expected behaviour.
---
 crates/path-cli/tests/goldens.rs              | 425 ++++++++++++++++++
 goldens/claude-to-codex/input.jsonl           |  80 ++++
 goldens/claude-to-codex/output.jsonl          | 136 ++++++
 goldens/codex-to-claude/input.jsonl           |  45 ++
 goldens/codex-to-claude/output.jsonl          |  44 ++
 .../codex-to-claude-illegal-types.tsv         |   7 +
 goldens/manifest.json                         |  26 ++
 scripts/goldens.sh                            |  29 ++
 8 files changed, 792 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 crates/path-cli/tests/goldens.rs
 create mode 100644 goldens/claude-to-codex/input.jsonl
 create mode 100644 goldens/claude-to-codex/output.jsonl
 create mode 100644 goldens/codex-to-claude/input.jsonl
 create mode 100644 goldens/codex-to-claude/output.jsonl
 create mode 100644 goldens/known-defect/codex-to-claude-illegal-types.tsv
 create mode 100644 goldens/manifest.json
