Subject: [PATCH] fix(goldens): capture-claude leak check allows only the
 attribution address, refuses the local username; bare ls

Allowlists exactly noreply@anthropic.com (Claude Code's Co-Authored-By constant, recorded in the set's manifest entry as leak_check), still refuses any other address; adds the local username (whole word) beside the home directory; the capture prompt runs bare ls with tool scope Bash(ls) so no owner/size/date columns enter the transcript.
