From 171bed8600f1d1b8d81dfe7119bc7eec6ca897b2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robert DeLanghe <1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 15:56:51 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(goldens): capture-live <claude|codex|pi|copilot> with
 per-agent drivers, seeded credentials, shared leak check

Generalises capture-claude: per-agent headless argv and transcript location, credential files copied (never printed) or env tokens forwarded into a temp HOME only, leak check also refuses any string from a seeded credential file, harness pin recorded, leak_check preserved across capture --all. cursor and opencode are refused with the reason. Unit tests for argv, leak check, secret extraction.
---
