From: Robert DeLanghe <1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 16:03:41 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix(goldens): capture-live redacts account identifiers
 instead of refusing them; secrets still refuse

Credential files split into secrets (refused if they reach the transcript) and account identifiers (account/user id, email-shaped account fields). Those, plus identity fields found in the transcript itself (creator_account_id, creator_user_id, userID, ...), are replaced by acct-/user-/email-redacted before the input is written and recorded under leak_check.redacted (field, placeholder, count; no values). Applies to claude, codex, pi and copilot. Home dir, username and non-allowlisted emails still refuse.
---
