Subject: [PATCH] feat(goldens): path goldens roundtrip (IR -> adapter -> IR
 per set); check pins losses and fails on new ones; provenance with codesign +
 upstream match

Round trip: IR1 = derive(input); X = project(IR1); IR2 = derive(X), one row per (set, adapter) in goldens/roundtrip/<set>-<adapter>.json listed in the manifest. Rows record steps, conversation text chars and tool uses before/after plus key paths lost and gained (artifact-URL and actor keys collapsed). check re-runs and fails only on a loss that was not pinned or less text/tools surviving; a pair that cannot be re-derived is pinned by its error. Also: path goldens provenance <agent> (codesign authority incl. nix wrapper resolution, upstream match via GitHub release digest or npm integrity; claude needs CLAUDE_RELEASE_BASE_URL).
