Subject: [PATCH] feat(goldens): path goldens shed [set] [--json]: per-stage
 bytes/chars/types, same-format round trip, dropped fields with examples,
 renames; DEMO.md says what is kept and shed

shed reports source -> IR -> each projection (lines, bytes, string chars, event types) and the source -> IR -> source round trip: event types shed, key paths lost/gained, renames (snake_case match), one example per dropped field (clipped to 40, sensitive fields withheld). --json writes goldens/shed/<set>.json, sha-listed in the manifest and verified by check. Confirms message.stop_reason -> message.stopReason in all three claude sets. DEMO.md classifies shed fields as by-design or defect.
