Subject: [PATCH] test: golden() stub factory
 (input/events/slice/with_field/first_string); roundtrip test runs on the
 captured claude session; FABRICATED tag

path_cli::goldens::golden(set) hands tests the captured bytes of a golden set. roundtrip_claude_conversation replaces its 7 hand-typed lines with the real 80-line claude session (all its assertions are relative, so they hold unchanged). test_cli_project_command keeps its hand-built Path and is tagged FABRICATED with the reason.
---
