From 27f7536ecd9ea00816fd6788e1603625ad48c6f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robert DeLanghe <1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 18:15:14 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] goldens: repo_rev 'code differs' counts only code;
 toolpath-golden fixtures crate; stopReason rename pinned as a known defect

1. Ruling 2026-10-08 18:01: the code-differs test compares only non-test .rs under crates/, Cargo.toml/Cargo.lock and scripts/goldens.sh, so a .qual record, docs, goldens or a test no longer turns check red (unit test: .qual + docs + test source stay green; a .rs source is a problem). 2. The test-only stub factory moves from path-cli into crates/toolpath-golden (publish = false, depends on serde_json only) so adapter crates can dev-depend on it without a cycle; path_cli::goldens re-exports it. 3. known-defect/claude-roundtrip-renames.tsv pins message.stop_reason -> message.stopReason (a claude -> IR -> claude round trip), computed on every check. Recaptured (outputs byte-identical).
---
 Cargo.lock                                    |   8 +
 Cargo.toml                                    |   3 +
 crates/path-cli/Cargo.toml                    |   1 +
 crates/path-cli/src/goldens.rs                | 165 +++++++-----------
 crates/path-cli/tests/goldens_producer.rs     |  15 +-
 crates/toolpath-golden/Cargo.toml             |  11 ++
 crates/toolpath-golden/src/lib.rs             | 123 +++++++++++++
